{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39776","headline":"投刑部裴郎中 · 黄滔","name":"投刑部裴郎中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"两牓驱牵别海涔，佗门不合觅知音。\n瞻恩虽隔云雷赐，向主终知犬马心。\n礼闱後人窥作镜，庙堂前席待爲霖。\n已齐日月悬千古，肯误风尘使陆沉。\n拜首敢将诚吐血，蜕形唯待诺如金。\n愁闻南院看期到，恐被东墙旧恨侵。\n缁化衣空难抵雪，黑销头尽不胜簪。\n数行泪里依投志，直比沧溟未是深。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"黄滔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39776.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39776","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}